WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.600
The first payment arrives about 5 weeks after you apply. Each month is an «assessment period» and you are paid about 7 days after it ends.

2
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:22.900
If you cannot wait, ask for an «advance payment»: it is a LOAN that you repay over 24 months from your payments.

3
00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:38.900
The «claimant commitment» is your agreement with the work coach: what you will do to look for work or earn more. You must accept it before the first payment. If you miss an appointment without a good reason, your payment can be cut (a «sanction»).

4
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:51.900
The «journal» is your online account: messages with your work coach, tasks (to-do list) and changes. Check it every few days. Report any change: work, address, partner or rent.

5
00:00:51.900 --> 00:00:59.100
Now do the lesson exercises. If you are unsure, watch this video again.
